 HISTORY BY ADVENTURING INTO THE UNKNOWN</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve the &quot;impossible&quot;: &quot;1-turn kill&quot;, Slay the Immortal, Speedrun City Building etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly replayable with varied goals, enemies, upgrades, terrains, treasures, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.poster.avif?t=1757388535\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.webm?t=1757388535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.mp4?t=1757388535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/3de8751ca4244dda3dea85a995d54a55.avif?t=1757388535\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 2 quick, teaser campaigns for you to see if it is right for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Badge of Honor&quot; Steam Achievements for the proven, skilled commanders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.poster.avif?t=1757388535\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.webm?t=1757388535\" type=\"video/webm;